{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will set up a coordinate system with the bottom-left corner of the large <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/7/c5710b9ed2db39023dcc1ba5c091fbc686204802.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 \\times 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> rectangle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and the top-right corner at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/360ee766dc7326e92b442d6756f07f134542e387.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(15,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>The first rectangle (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6d1796fdcd728ded419a7a296ff4929f63ef8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />) is aligned with the bottom-left corner, so it covers the region from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c975e64a5ed6e7d28e6f651e8102d070a417d4c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The second rectangle (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e63036be538ab89409639c8d4aa13268ddd3b09f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />) is aligned with the top-right corner. Its horizontal span goes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/4/f24956c3cc5f4fa140076136a3e52b5dc1d9649a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - 8 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a4662a1dcd96b0a6bc7d5abfe65f22109532a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, and its vertical span goes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3abbe3f6514a454894c06a8633cb26d18d8a079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 - 5 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ff8bbad79fc034a1b35329acef5492dc937ecd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The overlapping region is where their coordinates intersect:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Horizontally, they overlap from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c975e64a5ed6e7d28e6f651e8102d070a417d4c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, which gives a width of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/7358e9d10e40b24cc25d7bafea6b755e28e23cc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 - 7 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />.</li>\n<li>Vertically, they overlap from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/6389a3877e2c9d09826aa0c5e5aa564d8c355afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, which gives a height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc37d4beb5e84d2ed50434754dc62497f1b8d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 3 = 2$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>The area of this overlapping shaded rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6e5f37861d1d64b0a6afdd09ab2fad7644680a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07b47e3cb30d6717d865814ab1101da04ea84715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 110/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3657/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37395:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034428 and revision id 291907. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}